        "TileImage": "$($repository 7d28ed81-2b13-4a8f-8276-0216c5e8058d).Image",
        "Description": "Morning, 47. Welcome to the Burj Al-Ghazali. We have a peculiar assignment for you.\r\rOur client needs us to kill the assassin Zana and his contractor Omar. However, Zana is licensed to kill three guests at the party. Security is on high alert, so in order to not raise suspicion, we are allowing you to kill these three extra targets as well. \r\rThe Al-Ghazali guards are on very high alert and will notice if any other guests go missing, so you can&apos;t pacify anyone. I trust you will find a way, 47.",
        "GameVersion": "8.24.0.0",
        "IsPublished": true,
        "Entitlements": [
            "LOCATION_GOLDEN"
        ],
        "CreatorUserId": "69e1d495-20ee-4049-bcb0-9eb695eb93f2",
        "ServerVersion": "8.24.0.90",
